{
  "name": "@unlitcube/node-red-broute",
  "version": "2.0.0-beta.4",
  "type": "commonjs",
  "description": "Read Japanese low-voltage smart meters over the B-route with a Wi-SUN USB adapter (tested with RATOC RS-WSUHA). 低圧スマートメーターの B ルート計測ノードと Web UI。",
